# Green Rock — Features on Every Page

When building or modifying this project, **every page must include its complete feature set**. Do not ship placeholder-only pages.

## Public pages
Each public page must:
- Fetch live data from the backend API (`/api/...`)
- Fall back to mock data only if the API is unavailable
- Support search, filters, or detail views where applicable
- Wire forms (contact, inquiry, quote, newsletter, careers apply) to the API

## Admin pages (`/admin/*`)
Each admin section must use `AdminCRUD` with:
- **Create** (Add New button + form dialog)
- **Edit** (pencil icon + pre-filled form)
- **Delete** (trash icon with confirm)
- **Image upload** (`ImageUpload` / `SingleImageUpload`) where relevant
- Auth guard via `AdminShell` (admin/manager only)

## Page checklist

| Public | Admin |
|--------|-------|
| `/` home sections | `/admin/dashboard` |
| `/properties` | `/admin/properties` |
| `/projects` | `/admin/projects` |
| `/materials` | `/admin/products` |
| `/services`, `/services/[slug]` | `/admin/services` |
| `/blog`, `/blog/[slug]` | `/admin/blog` |
| `/careers`, `/careers/[slug]` | `/admin/careers` |
| `/gallery` | `/admin/gallery` |
| `/testimonials` | `/admin/testimonials` |
| `/contact` | `/admin/messages` |
| `/about` | `/admin/users`, `/admin/categories`, `/admin/partners`, `/admin/settings` |
| `/properties/[slug]` | — |
| `/projects/[slug]` | — |
| `/materials/[slug]` | — |

## Patterns
- Public data: `fetchPublic()` from `@/lib/server-api` (server) or React Query (client)
- Admin CRUD: `@/components/admin/AdminCRUD` + fields from `@/lib/admin-resources`
- Uploads: `@/lib/upload` → `POST /api/upload` (Cloudinary or local `/uploads`)

Never add a new content type without both a **public page** and an **admin CRUD page**.
